"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4-dev.7\n- Affects all versions after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96922 was merged\n\n### System information\n\nGodot 4.4 dev 7 - all platforms\n\n### Issue description\n\nPR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96922 moved the MeshLibrary palette for GridMaps to the bottom panel.\nHowever, you can still find the `editors/grid_map/editor_side` option in the editor settings. \n\nThis option no longer has an effect and can be removed. \n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b3d3a3d-3c4d-4f69-b350-88ca99638274)\n\nWhen looking at the diff of the PR, you can see that all occurrences of this editor setting were removed. It is not used anywhere else, so it's a pointless option now.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn Godot 4.4 Dev 7, navigate to the Editor Settings and look for the \"Editor Side\" option.\n\n- Editor > Editor Settings \n- Editors > Grid Map > Editor Side\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us